+# HealthCheckup Smart Search v7.63.99 — Production Only
+
+## What changed
+
+- Section **09 ตารางโปรแกรม** added after 00–08 in Full Page annual company editor.
+- Editable program-comparison matrix: program names/prices, English and Thai exam descriptions, per-program ✓ / shaded not-included / blank states, add/remove programs (up to 10) and exam rows (up to 200).
+- **Use 32-row example** button seeds the sample exam list (adapted from the supplied image); all values are editable.
+- Section **10 รายการตรวจเพิ่มเติม** is now the sole location for the existing Billing and Cash lists, preserving their IDs and original persistence.
+- Matrix JSON is saved in the existing `company_year_circulars.memo_data` field; no destructive database migration is necessary.
+- When generating PDF, the app produces the original corporate circular, then a new A4 multi-page matrix appendix **before user-uploaded PDF attachments**. Generated main-PDF history is retained as before.
+- The Section 09 'บันทึกตารางและดู PDF' button saves annual/circular data and generates a live preview; the footer action still saves and creates a versioned primary PDF.
+- Includes work from the previous unpublished attachment-merge correction: preview and primary generation both include existing uploaded PDFs.
+
+## Safety / release
+
+- No legacy company-year document rows are migrated, deleted or overwritten.
+- Production-only port/database checks, installer and Update Center helper unchanged except version metadata.
+- Release tests: see `npm run test:release` output; 57/57 tests passed in build environment.
+- End-to-end PDF generation and deployment on Windows Server with a real PostgreSQL connection still require UAT. Node dependencies were unavailable in the current build container, so actual pdf-lib rendering was not exercised here.
